      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel the desire to not have your avatar be marked as Very Poor, just because you'd like to support your haptic vest, is really valid but maybe something that can be added to an avatar but is local only so it's not going to affect performance for other users AT ALL. Would be the best option. I even saw another post mention this.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/seperate-local-only-contact-type-for-osc-haptics-on-optimised-avatars\nWorth a look into and could spawn some even better ideas.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
