      "value": "@{5e66cf0a0ec70928e59f9b5f|full_name}: I made a reply to this post where I talk about maybe we should explore solutions that don't need to even run through anything but local end. I mean if the controllers' avatar-haptics coming out is local only, why not have this be too? It's a win win. Haptic vest support and avatars stay the same performance :)",
