  "details": "I managed to rig an X40 bHaptics vest onto my avatar utilizing OSC, and Avatar Dynamics.\nIt's great to have contact with friends, but each haptic point on the vest (total of 40) exceeds the threshold of 32 until my Good-ranked avatar immediately is seen as Very Poor; cannot use an avatar with haptics without showing and filtered by Safety settings as unoptimized.\nPlease raise the threshold for contact count for PC users to 40+.",
